{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Complementary_Counting)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Complementary Counting)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Whole_number\" title=\"Whole number\">whole numbers</a> between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e8924412a12becf7905729885a46e3e351ec5a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> contain the digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/7/017b18f480549c1e7fa3ee0c26802e547fad0120.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 100 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 120 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 138 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 140 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 148$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"421\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Complementary_Counting.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Complementary_Counting)\">Solution 1 (Complementary Counting)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Complementary Counting)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e8924412a12becf7905729885a46e3e351ec5a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> does not contain the digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, only the set of integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/3/4f39a3242724f70e81d9037b59cca455b4794683.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$399$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> needs to be considered.  Notice that this is the set of all three-digit integers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as their first digit.  \n</p><p>Since there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> choices for the first digit and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> choices for each of the second and third digits, this set contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/72099d375bce72b3b34b0b18e92e0e373e954821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\cdot 100 \\cdot 100 = 300$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"14\" /> numbers.\n</p><p>For a three-digit integer between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/3/4f39a3242724f70e81d9037b59cca455b4794683.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$399$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> that does not contain the digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/6/296f0bc50ac812f710edefec4457e24fa31935c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-1=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> choices for the first digit and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/478a1a763d8df83197f5c19063eb8dc8dca9a5e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10-1=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" /> choices for each of the second and third digit, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/6/40665e67ef0be50ff327845d862afd98ee4bbd2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 9 = 162$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"14\" /> numbers.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20e25a8402d1224948718d9702177e1799f46b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300 - 162 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 138}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"176\" height=\"30\" /> of these numbers contain the digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/1/fe1badfbd11d08c1e53f2d27fca96dae4b664105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$299$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  \n</p><p>Of the integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e8924412a12becf7905729885a46e3e351ec5a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> not starting with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> have a second digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f53c6b7d558eeda1ffc6a9d6e142df1f9722449a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{120, 121, 122, \\cdots, 129, 320, 321, 322, \\cdots, 329\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"365\" height=\"20\" />, while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> have a third digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/3/9f34d4f34ee1f19cd650acc1844a12e168a1d875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{102, 112, 122, \\cdots, 192, 302, 312, 322, \\cdots, 392\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"365\" height=\"20\" />. Of these, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/8/7a8948c71337e6ef8aac086dd7444c757c379b53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$122$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/0/4104d093e8cb91695fd6787ce75397863b30c0e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$322$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> have both a second and third digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/d/91d544d62a960aaea218bba1b688e56adfed7901.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 + 20 - 2 = 38$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"15\" /> integers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e8924412a12becf7905729885a46e3e351ec5a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> not starting with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> contain the digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6fbd27f8ded29a03ad1090525804e7e4418d76e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 + 38 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 138}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"166\" height=\"30\" /> integers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e8924412a12becf7905729885a46e3e351ec5a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> contain the digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9APPn2mC8t8\">https://youtu.be/9APPn2mC8t8</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017175115\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 305/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2302/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8334/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.915      1 -total\n 59.23%    8.242      1 Template:AJHSME_box\n 38.25%    5.323      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7663:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017175115 and revision id 280497. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}